# tally 2.1.8 item 77 (item 14 of the third turn), the guard beside L4_4_pending_leg_not_refused: oa's own
# 60.00 PLN breaks pot on each day of its window, tested in the day's batch, so the hole reaches its other end
# (j1) and its flows (j3); each pin is the refusal.
# tally 2.2 (2.2-4): the clause `windows each` is cut; its asks are the plain line, the hole with each unknown day it
# carries named (`unknown day:`, 2.2-11). A caller who takes the window as one day pins its cell.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind savings: place PLN min 0
place pot: savings lives 2025-01-01..
place jar: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input wa: date
input db: date
input small: money PLN
input amt2: money PLN

move oa: transfers
  on wa
  leg cash from pot to jar amount small

move ob: transfers
  on db
  leg cash from pot to world amount amt2

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  small = 60.00 PLN "s"
  amt2 = 1.00 PLN "s"
  wa = one_of([2026-04-05, 2026-04-09]) "s"
  db = 2026-05-07 "s"
  opening[pot] = 50.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[jar] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask j1: bal(jar, 2026-04-30)
ask j2: bal(jar, 2026-04-30)
ask j3: flows(oa, 2026-04)
ask j4: bal(jar, 2026-04-30) with wa = 2026-04-05
ask j5: bal(jar, 2026-04-30) with wa = 2026-04-09
ask j6: flows(oa, 2026-04) with wa = 2026-04-09
=== expect
j1: ?"date within one_of([2026-04-05, 2026-04-09]) not precise enough for a balance" (oa)
  unknown day: wa
  cut 2026-01-01
j2: ?"date within one_of([2026-04-05, 2026-04-09]) not precise enough for a balance" (oa)
  unknown day: wa
  cut 2026-01-01
j3: ?"date within one_of([2026-04-05, 2026-04-09]) not precise enough for flows of oa" (oa)
  unknown day: wa
  cut 2026-01-01
j4: refused: RUN-PLACE pot is -10.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-04-05
  pinned: wa = 2026-04-05
  cut 2026-01-01
j5: refused: RUN-PLACE pot is -10.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-04-09
  pinned: wa = 2026-04-09
  cut 2026-01-01
j6: refused: RUN-PLACE pot is -10.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-04-09
  pinned: wa = 2026-04-09
  cut 2026-01-01
